  "warnings": [],
  "text": "## For Digital Screen (page 38)\n[E1] 12:00 | 22\n[E2] (NOTE) Fuel consumption will only be shown when the vehicle is under operation, and the fuel range value will be updated while the vehicle is driven condition.\n[E3] (NOTE) The displayed fuel consumption and range values are estimates, and the actual values may vary from those shown.\n\n## IF PRESS JOYSTICK LEFT (pages 36-37)\n[E4] The following details are displayed on the advanced dashboard.\n[E5] Trip 1\n[E6] Trip 2\n[E7] Fuel range\n[E8] Instantaneous fuel consumption\n[E9] Battery gauge\n[E10] Service Due In\n[E11] Engine temperature\n[E12] The above details can be customized in my vehicle option available in the settings menu.\n\n## iii. Fuel consumption (pages 49-50)\n[E13] Center press the joystick with the fuel consumption option selected to explore the options.\n[E14] The following options are available in the menu.\n[E15] km/l\n[E16] L/100 km\n[E17] mpg (UK)\n[E18] mpg (US)\n[E19] The options can be navigated by joystick up and down press and selected by joystick center press.\n[E20] Press the home button on the LH switch cube to go back.\n[E21] (NOTE) If the speed/distance is in km then either km/l or L/100 km options are available to select and the remaining options are grayed out.\n[E22] 0\n[E23] 0\n[E24] If the speed/distance is not in km (in mpg) then either mpg (UK) or mpg (US) options are available to select and the remaining options are grayed out."
